description: Enforce UTF-8 and prevent garbled Chinese text
alwaysApply: true
---

# Encoding Rules

- Save all Vue, JS, Java, XML, SQL, YAML, JSON, and Markdown files as UTF-8.
- Never use GBK, ANSI, or UTF-16 for source files containing Chinese text.
- Read an existing file before modifying it.
- When writing files from PowerShell, explicitly specify UTF-8 encoding.
- Do not use default-encoding Out-File or Set-Content for Chinese text.
- After adding or changing Chinese text, check for replacement characters or mojibake.
- Keep Chinese text in source code, SQL, API responses, and UI unchanged.
- After changes, verify both static page text and API response text.
